          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "Kweku's realm is the vast network of Martian lava tubes, remnants of the planet’s volcanic past. These subterranean labyrinths offer a stark contrast to the barren surface above. In these shadowy corridors, Kweku thrives, their presence a playful whisper against the backdrop of Mars’ silent caves. Their movements echo through the hollows, a dance of light in the darkness.",
